*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% CUPS PostScript Printer Description (PPD) File
*% Model: Fuji Xerox DocuCentre S2110 / S2011 / S2320 / S2520
*% Language: HBPL (Host Based Print Language)
*% Driver: rastertohbpl Native CUPS Filter for macOS
*% Target: Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3/M4) & Intel x86_64
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "FXS2110.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Fuji Xerox"
*Product: "(DocuCentre S2110)"
*ModelName: "Fuji Xerox DocuCentre S2110"
*ShortNickName: "FX DocuCentre S2110"
*NickName: "Fuji Xerox DocuCentre S2110 (HBPL Native CUPS Driver)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 550"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "21"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Fuji Xerox;MDL:DocuCentre S2110;CMD:HBPL;"

*% 核心转译滤镜定义 (macOS SIP 合规独立路径)
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/FujiXerox/Filters/rastertohbpl"

*% 分辨率选项 (默认 600 DPI 高清输出)
*OpenUI *Resolution/Output Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 x 600 DPI (High Quality): "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% 颜色模式 (纯黑白灰度)
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale (8-bit): "<</cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsBitsPerPixel 8>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Black/Monochrome (1-bit): "<</cupsColorSpace 3/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsBitsPerPixel 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% 纸张规格选项
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4 (210 x 297 mm): "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A3/A3 (297 x 420 mm): "<</PageSize[842 1191]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B4/B4 (257 x 364 mm): "<</PageSize[729 1032]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5 (182 x 257 mm): "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/Letter (8.5 x 11 in): "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/Legal (8.5 x 14 in): "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 8K/8K (267 x 388 mm): "<</PageSize[757 1100]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 16K/16K (194 x 267 mm): "<</PageSize[550 757]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*% 纸张物理边界 (PageRegion)
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A3/A3: "<</PageSize[842 1191]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B4/B4: "<</PageSize[729 1032]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 8K/8K: "<</PageSize[757 1100]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 16K/16K: "<</PageSize[550 757]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% 可成像区域 (边距 4mm)
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "11.34 11.34 583.66 830.66"
*ImageableArea A3/A3: "11.34 11.34 830.66 1179.66"
*ImageableArea B4/B4: "11.34 11.34 717.66 1020.66"
*ImageableArea B5/B5: "11.34 11.34 504.66 717.66"
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter: "11.34 11.34 600.66 780.66"
*ImageableArea Legal/Legal: "11.34 11.34 600.66 996.66"
*ImageableArea 8K/8K: "11.34 11.34 745.66 1088.66"
*ImageableArea 16K/16K: "11.34 11.34 538.66 745.66"

*% 物理纸张尺寸 (单位: Point)
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A3/A3: "842 1191"
*PaperDimension B4/B4: "729 1032"
*PaperDimension B5/B5: "516 729"
*PaperDimension Letter/Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension 8K/8K: "757 1100"
*PaperDimension 16K/16K: "550 757"

*% 纸盒进纸选项 (InputSlot)
*OpenUI *InputSlot/Paper Source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Auto
*InputSlot Auto/Auto Select (自动选择): ""
*InputSlot Tray1/Tray 1 (纸盒 1): "<</MediaPosition 1>>setpagedevice"
*InputSlot Tray2/Tray 2 (纸盒 2 - 选配件): "<</MediaPosition 2>>setpagedevice"
*InputSlot Bypass/Bypass Tray (旁路手送托盘): "<</MediaPosition 3>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*% 双面打印选项 (Duplex)
*OpenUI *Duplex/2-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off (1-Sided 单面): "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long-Edge Binding (长边翻转双面): "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short-Edge Binding (短边翻转双面): "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*% 节墨模式 (Toner Save)
*OpenUI *JCLTonerSave/Toner Save Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 JCLSetup *JCLTonerSave
*DefaultJCLTonerSave: Standard
*JCLTonerSave Standard/Standard (标准省墨关): ""
*JCLTonerSave Save/Save (节墨开启): ""
*CloseUI: *JCLTonerSave

*% 复合机特有 JCL 协议头注入定义
*JCLBegin: "<1B>%-12345X@PJL<0D><0A>"
*JCLToPSInterpreter: ""
*JCLEnd: "<1B>%-12345X@PJL EOJ<0D><0A><1B>%-12345X"

*% PPD 文件结束
*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
*Font Symbol: Special "(001.007S)" Special ROM
